PROJECT CONTEXT

Backend:
- Struts 6.x (Jakarta-based)
- Java 13 SE
- DAO layer uses JdbcTemplate / NamedParameterJdbcTemplate
- Service layer constructs DAOs manually and injects JDBC templates via DAO constructors

- No annotations for DI, controllers, or validation
- All Struts actions configured in struts.xml
- All layouts defined in tiles.xml
- JSON responses use Struts 6 JSON plugin (no <root>, includeProperties filters)
- JSON response shape: { reservationLineItemDTO: {...}, actionMessages: [...] }
- Tomcat 9 (javax environment)
- do not use Interfaces in the design


Frontend:
- JSP 2.3 + JSTL 1.2
- Apache Tiles for layout
- Bootstrap 4.6.2
- jQuery 3.6.0
- ES6 JavaScript modules

JavaScript conventions:
- All AJAX uses fetch() + async/await (no jQuery AJAX)
- Use showActionMessage(message, type) for UI alerts
- appendRequestedEquipmentRow() inserts new line items
- Properties panels use .toggle-properties buttons
- DOM anchors use predictable IDs (e.g., #add-equipment-card)

Workflow:
- Stateless, selector-driven UI
- JSPs remain declarative
- JS handles all dynamic updates

